ølgende svar:\n\n## Varslingstidspunkt i Altinn 3 Correspondence\n\n**Hovedvarsel:**\n- Sendes **5 minutter etter publiseringstidspunktet** for meldingen. Hvis publiseringstidspunktet allerede er i fortiden, sendes varselet 5 minutter etter gjeldende tidspunkt.\n\n**Påminnelse (re-varsel):**\n- Hvis påminnelser er aktivert (`sendReminder: true`), sendes revarselet ut **etter 7 dager** dersom meldingen ikke har blitt lest.\n- I **test-** og **stagingmiljøer** skjer dette etter 1 dag grunnet midliderige begrensninger i varsel-tjenesten (det arbeides med å gjenopprette tidligere 1-times intervaller).\n\n## SMS – tidsvindu for sending\n\nSMS-varsler har et spesielt sendevinduet som skiller seg fra e-post:\n\n- **SMS varsles kun mellom kl. 09:00 og 17:00**\n- Hvis avsendingstidspunktet faller utenfor dette vinduet, vil SMS-vadselet bli utsatt til neste dag (og sendt innenfor tidsvinduet)\n\nE-post har derimot **intett tidvindu**.\n\nDette kan styres via feltet `notificationChannel` i varslingbestillingen når en melding opprettes.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-corr-02-varsling-tidspunkt", :empty? false, :llm-calls 10, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 3002, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "deployed+enrichment", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-correspondence,compound", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "da960f8906327 R19.6 P2.5 h2.0 or1.0 L10384 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Notifications", :response-chars 1058, :source "new", :search-passes 2, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 4, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "9c58e66b93a3;5feebb206964", :enrichment-hits 87, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? false, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 81929, :pool-head "d381a15b18ef8 R21.8 P1.6 h1.0 or0.8 L1958 1/? ty:content b[0.1,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.1,0.0] | Send condition ;; d381a15b18ef8 R21.5 P2.6 h2.0 or0.5 L428 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.1,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.1,0.0] | Send condition ;; de4ee6d652572 R20.5 P1.4 h1.0 or0.8 L877 3/? ty:content b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Temp", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "9c58e66b93a3", :expected-chunk-ids "0af9eaceae9e", :elapsed-ms 585835, :issued-queries "påminnelse sendes varsel correspondent | Sms sendedager tidspunkt altinn correspondence | varsel påminnelse boks 202 sentrefiering | Altinn notification send condition work day reminder | SMS sending hours 09:00 17:00 business time Altinn varsel", :timestamp "2026-06-12T07:47:28.766911Z", :total-tokens 84931, :run-id "fa24be5c-209d-4fe3-be25-d4136371df88", :golden-display-rank 4, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 0.0} {:response "Based on the provided documentation, the following properties can be configured within the `pages` object of a `Settings.json` file for an Altinn app layout set [1]:\n\n- **hideCloseButton** (Boolean): Determines whether to hide the \"back to inbox\" button in the upper left corner.\n- **showLanguageSelector** (Boolean): Controls whether the language selector is visible, allowing users to switch languages after opening the form.\n- **showExpandWidthButton** (Boolean): Specifies whether an expand width button should be visible so users can fill their browser window with the page.\n- **showProgress** (Boolean): Toggles the progress indicator for navigation [1].\n- **pdfLayoutName** (String): Defines a custom layout name used in PDF configuration and generation [1].\n- **order** (Array): Sets the sequence of pages or tasks to display in the side menu/navigation [1].\n- **groups** (Array): Used to group pages within the application's navigation UI [1].\n- **excludeFromPdf** (Array): Lists which pages should be excluded from automatic PDF configuration/generation [1].\n- **expandedWidth** (Boolean): Controls whether a page automatically expands to full browser width when opened. This setting can be defined at multiple levels (`layout-sets.json`, `Settings.json`, or individual layout files), where more specific values override general ones, and it is valid inside the `pages` object of `Settings.json` [1].\n\nAll listed properties are explicitly documented as configurable within the `pages` section of a settings file for Altinn v4 App Frontend layouts.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-studio-01-page-settings-properties", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 412, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "compound,lookup,altinn-studio,list", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dd8e7dc7970dc R22.0 P2.6 h2.0 or1.1 L8500 1/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Pages", :response-chars 1557, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "7df452fd81ec", :enrichment-hits 0, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 7827, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "7df452fd81ec", :expected-chunk-ids "7df452fd81ec", :elapsed-ms 226364, :issued-queries "pages object settings json configuration options layout set altinn app | settings json pages pageSets | LayoutSettings pages config", :timestamp "2026-06-12T07:48:11.085585Z", :total-tokens 8239, :run-id "12e98e4c-2443-4433-95d6-62e5aaa6468d", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Based on the provided context, you can configure the following settings within the `pages` object of the `Settings.json` file for a layout set in an Altinn app [1]:\n\n- **hideCloseButton** (`Boolean`) – Controls whether or not the back to inbox button in the upper left corner should be hidden [1].\n- **showLanguageSelector** (`Boolean`) – Determines if the language selector is visible, allowing users to switch languages after opening the form [1].\n- **showExpandWidthButton** (`Boolean`) – Toggles visibility of the expand width button, which lets users fill their browser window with the page [1].\n- **showProgress** (`Boolean`) – Controls whether a progress indicator is shown in navigation [1].\n- **pdfLayoutName** (`String`) – Specifies custom layout configuration for PDF generation [1].\n- **order** (`Array`) – Defines the sequential order of pages/tasks to display in side menus or navigation [1].\n- **groups** (`Array`) – Used to group pages together in navigation/UX views [1].\n- **excludeFromPdf** (`Array`) – Lists page elements that should be excluded from automatic PDF configuration/generation [1].\n- **expandedWidth** (`Boolean`) – Sets whether a layout automatically expands to the full width of the browser window when opened; this baseline can be overridden by more specific configurations in `layout-sets.json` or individual layout files if needed [1].\n\nAll listed properties are placed directly under the `\"pages\"` object inside each respective `Settings.json` file for your layout sets, and they are configured separately per task/layout set as defined in `layout-sets.json` [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-studio-01-page-settings-properties", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 379, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed+enrichment", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "compound,lookup,altinn-studio,list", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dd8e7dc7970dc R24.9 P2.7 h2.0 or1.7 L8500 1/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Pages", :response-chars 1602, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "7df452fd81ec", :enrichment-hits 66, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8097, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "7df452fd81ec", :expected-chunk-ids "7df452fd81ec", :elapsed-ms 268360, :issued-queries "settings.json pages layout set | Settings.json configuration properties | layout settings altinn", :timestamp "2026-06-12T07:48:58.791748Z", :total-tokens 8476, :run-id "d85441ed-f370-4c71-b1be-f49c49362c2c", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Basert på konteksten kan følgende egenskaper/innstillinger konfigureres i `pages`-objektet i filen `Settings.json`: [1]\n\n| Egenskap | Type | Beskrivelse/Verdi (ifølge kilde) |\n|---|---|---|\n| `hideCloseButton` | Boolean | Om tilbake til innboks-knappen skal skjules eller ikke. |\n| `showLanguageSelector` | Boolean | Om språkvelgeren skal vises slik at brukeren kan bytte etter at utfyllingen er startet. |\n| `showExpandWidthButton` | Boolean | Om utvid bredde-knappen skal vises slik at siden fyller hele nettleservinduet. |\n| `showProgress` | Boolean | Viser en fremdriftsindikator (henvisning til navigasjonsdokumentasjon). |\n| `pdfLayoutName` | String | Angir navnet på PDF-layouten som skal brukes ved utskrift (henvisning til PDF-dokumentasjon). |\n| `order` | Array | Definerer rekkefølgen på sidene/oppgavene i sidelisten/sidemenyen. |\n| `groups` | Array | Brukes for å gruppere sider henholdsvis oppgaver i menyen. |\n| `excludeFromPdf` | Array | Angir hvilke sider som skal ekskluderes automatisk ved generering av PDF. |\n| `expandedWidth` | Boolean | Setter standard breddehåndtering til utvidet slik at siden fyller hele nettleservinduet ved åpning. [1]\n\nAlle disse listes opp i konteksten under overskriften «De tilgjengelige innstillingene er følgende:» som direkte hører til konfigurasjonen av `pages`-objektet i layoutsettings for Altinn Studio-appen.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-studio-02-sideinnstillinger", :empty? false, :llm-calls 2, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 354, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "compound,lookup,altinn-studio,list", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d20cbf3c2523d R21.3 P2.6 h2.0 or0.7 L8265 1/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Pages", :response-chars 1365, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "9d39215978ac;d2209cafc7cc", :enrichment-hits 0, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 6398, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "9d39215978ac", :expected-chunk-ids "d2209cafc7cc", :elapsed-ms 229412, :issued-queries "pages objekt Settings.json innstillinger | Settings.json pages configuration Altinn app | page settings layout grid", :timestamp "2026-06-12T07:51:18.181112Z", :total-tokens 6752, :run-id "d3e10225-24ff-4cc3-a051-25fb0795667c", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Basert på konteksten kan følgende innstillinger konfigureres i `pages`-objektet i filen: [1] \n\n| Egenskap              | Type    | Verdi                                                                                                                          |\n| --------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| **hideCloseButton**       | Boolean | Om tilbake til innboks-knappen øverst i venstre hjørne skal skjules eller ikke.                                                |\n| **showLanguageSelector**| Boolean | Lar brukeren bytte språk etter de har startet skjemautfyllingen) [1]\n- `expandedWidth` (Boolean): se [Utvidet-skjema-bredde](#utvidet-skin-egenskapene er følgende:\n\n**hideCloseButton** (Boolean]: Om tilbake til innboks-knappen øverst i venstre hjørne skal skjules eller ikke. [1]\n   - **showExpandWidthB:** Lar bruker kan endre bredden på siden slik at den fyller hele nettleservinduet.) \n\n*(Jeg kommer med en ren oversikt basert utelukkende på kildeteksten.)*\n\nSiden konteksten spesifiserer at disse innstillingene i `Settings.json` for sidene (for hver layout-sett) finner du nederst: [1]\n\n| Egenskap              | Type    | Verdi                                                                                                                          |\n| --------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n   - **hideCloseButton**       | Boolean | Om tilbake til innboks-knappen øverst i venstre hjørne skal skjules eller ikke.                                                |\n| showLanguageSelector  | Boolean | Lar brukeren bytte språk etter de har startet skjemautfyllingen) [1]\n\n- **showExpandWidthB:** \"Om utvid bredde-knapp skal vises eller ikkje.) [1]\n   - `expandedWidth` (Boolean: se Navigasjons-dokumentasjon for egendefinert-skjema-bredde](#utvidet-skin-egenskapene er følgende::\n\n| Egenskap              | Type    | Verdi                                                                                                                          |\n| --------------------- | ------- | -----------------------------------