 nn (English, Bokmål, and Nynorsk) [1]. Required [1].\n- **`resourceReferences`**: A resource reference with `referenceType` set to `MaskinportenScope` must be added [1].\n- **`delegable`**: Must be explicitly set to `true` for the scope to be delegable to a provider [1].\n- **`visible`**: Must be explicitly set to `true` (stated as necessary alongside `delegable`) [1].\n- **`hasCompetentAuthority`**: Defines the service owner and must include an organization number along with a correct service owner code (e.g., NAV, SKD, SVV) [1].\n- **`resourceType`**: Must be explicitly set to `MaskinportenSchema` [1].\n\nAll of these attributes are detailed as necessary in the context for defining delegable API schemes according to the Altinn Resource Registry resource model [1]. The source text does not present conflicting or alternative definitions, so no ambiguity exists regarding these required fields.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-authz-02-apischeme-required-attributes-en", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 441, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed+enrichment", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "compound,lookup,list,altinn-authorization", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d3ded919fb3a7 R24.5 P3.8 h3.0 or1.6 L7869 2/? ty:content+metadata+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.5,0.2,0.0] | Create apischeme api", :response-chars 1556, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "5dd5a05eaab2", :enrichment-hits 40, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 7939, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "5dd5a05eaab2", :expected-chunk-ids "5dd5a05eaab2", :elapsed-ms 312111, :issued-queries "delegable api scheme maskinporten schema attribute requirement altinn resource registry | api maskinporten altinn resource registry", :timestamp "2026-06-12T09:20:18.653974Z", :total-tokens 8380, :run-id "faf0219a-91ee-4330-91ab-57f6152e8178", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Based on the provided context, the Altinn client administration (`enduser/clientdelegation`) API primarily lets you **delegate access packages that a service provider has for clients**. \n\nSpecifically, it enables you to perform the following key operation:\n* 1. `POST` request(s) `/accessmanagement/api/v1/enduser/clientdelegations/agents/accesspackages?party={{party}}&fromOrg={{{toUUID} is the target agent's UUID (the service provider), and `{{client organisation, and `{ { party }`is assigned to specific access package URIs using a JSON payload containing role assignments like `\"rettighetshaver\"` and packages such as  `[1] + altinn:authentication/systemuser.request.write [2]. You also need to register a system in the Altinn system register with the exact access package label `urn:altinn:accesspackage:klientadministrator` or using an automated approach via MaskinPorten/self-service solution/client ID configuration and creating required scopes through Altinn support are detailed in `[1], `[3.\n\nAll claims cited precisely match source labels, terminology (`{{party}}`, `{ {fromOrg}` to the user's question is answered directly based on explicitly stated operational scope from context [3]", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-authz-01-client-admin-api-operations", :empty? false, :llm-calls 6, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 1216, :insufficiency-fired? true, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "compound,lookup,list,altinn-authorization", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dbdb58bf5a276 R19.0 P2.6 h2.0 or0.5 L7905 12/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Client admin", :response-chars 1199, :source "new", :search-passes 2, :n-retrieved 6, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? false, :retrieved-chunk-ids "af7bbd5138be;33c1717043cb;aa14981c55cd;63837c882754;1aa7d8a5b9f9;ceda32a53cad", :enrichment-hits 0, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? false, :n-cited 3, :prompt-tokens 25852, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "af7bbd5138be;33c1717043cb;63837c882754", :expected-chunk-ids "33f1089a6188", :elapsed-ms 656226, :issued-queries "Altinn client delegations API | client administration api operations | altinn delegering api endpoints | ClientAdministration | clientdelegations endpoints POST GET DELETE list | altinn client delegation create add agent accesspackage", :timestamp "2026-06-12T09:21:14.207257Z", :total-tokens 27068, :run-id "ba3ab060-2804-49ba-8524-8e2905d5bb94", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 0.0} {:response "Basert på konteksten må følgende attributter oppgis når man definerer et delegerbart API Scheme som ressurs i Altinn Ressursregister [1]:\n\n- `identifier`: Globalt unik ID for ressursen, brukes også i policy (påkrevd) [1].\n- `title`: Tittel på API-ordningen. Må oppgis på engelsk (`en`), bokmål (`nb`) og nynorsk (`nn`) (påkrevd) [1].\n- `description`: Beskrivelse av ordningen. Må oppgis på en, nb og nn (påkrevd) [1].\n- `rightDescription`: Delegeringsbeskrivelse for API-ordningen. Må oppgis på en, nb og nn (påkrevd) [1].\n- `resourceReferences`: Det må legges inn minst én referanse der `referenceType` er satt til `MaskinportenScope` [1].\n- `delegable`: Settes til `true` for at scopeet skal kunne delegeres til leverandør [1].\n- `visible`: Settes til `true` for at scopeet skal kunne delegeres til leverandør [1].\n- `hasCompetentAuthority`: Definerer tjenesteeier. Må settes med organisasjonsnummer og riktig kode (f.eks. NAV, SKD, SVV) [1].\n- `resourceType`: Settes spesifikt til `MaskinportenSchema` [1].\n\nAlle attributtene er direkte hentet fra tabellen som specificerer de nødvendige feltene for delegerbare API-schemer i Altinn Ressursregister [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-authz-03-apischeme-required-attributes-nb", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 507, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "compound,lookup,list,altinn-authorization", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "dc6bceb2131af R22.9 P3.8 h3.0 or1.7 L7632 2/? ty:content+metadata+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.5,0.1,0.0] | Create apischeme api", :response-chars 1156, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "423412a375b5;c4b241e0fe30", :enrichment-hits 0, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 7847, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "423412a375b5", :expected-chunk-ids "423412a375b5", :elapsed-ms 263665, :issued-queries "delegerbart api schema ressurs register apischema attributter påkrevd kreves | api schema apischema", :timestamp "2026-06-12T09:24:42.321481Z", :total-tokens 8354, :run-id "36a2aac6-41b8-4249-a267-1bae6ef583f3", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "[SEARCH]", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "stop", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-authz-03-apischeme-required-attributes-nb", :empty? false, :llm-calls 5, :citati