entType`: \n    *   `0` = Plain text\n    *   `1` = Html\n*   `notificationChannel`: \n    *   `0` = Email\n    *   `1` = Sms\n    *   `2` = EmailPreferred\n    *   `3` = SmsPreferred\n    *   `4` = EmailAndSms\n\nIf you are referring to parameters outside of these notification/initialization configurations (such as physical transmission methods like postal mail or electronic archive formats), this specific field and its numeric values **are not documented** in the provided sources. \n\nYou can see an example payload where a message is initialized with some of these mappings below:\n```json\n{ \"correspondence\": { ..., \n\"notificationTemplate\": CustomMessage (0) | GenericAltinnMessage(1), \n\"notificationChannel\": Email(0) | Sms(1) | EmailPreferred(2) | SmsPreferred(3) | EmailAndSms(4)...}}\n```", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-corr-03-transmission-types", :empty? false, :llm-calls 10, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 1656, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "deployed+enrichment", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "altinn-correspondence,compound,lookup,list", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d405e5c9efcc6 R24.5 P2.6 h2.0 or1.7 L2869 1/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Dialogporten arbeidsflate", :response-chars 1518, :source "new", :search-passes 4, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? false, :retrieved-chunk-ids "29d2607ef0bd;f8eabe6d3ce3", :enrichment-hits 239, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? false, :n-cited 0, :prompt-tokens 115668, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "", :expected-chunk-ids "9fc8a7bd7ec2", :elapsed-ms 609287, :issued-queries "Altinn 3 correspondence api transmission type | altinn svarutkast sendingstype verdiar | correspo