nstance owners new instances can be created for. See PartyTypesAllowed for details [1].\n- `autoDeleteOnProcessEnd`: A value indicating whether an instance will be automatically deleted once the process ends; this can be used by highly sensitive applications to force an instance delete instead of sending it to the archive [2].\n- `presentationFields`: A collection of presentation fields, currently not in use. See PresentationField for details [1].\n- `dataFields`: A collection of data fields. See DataField for details [2].\n- `eFormidling`: The configuration for the eFormidling integration for the application. See eFormidlingContract for details [1].\n- `messageBoxConfig`: A collection of configurations related to the Altinn Message box [2].\n\nAll field names and descriptions are preserved exactly as labeled in the source documentation, with citations provided per claim as required. If you need deeper definitions (e.g., DataType or PartyTypesAllowed), additional context beyond this table would be needed.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-api-04-app-metadata-fields-en", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 461, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed+enrichment", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "compound,lookup,altinn-3-general,list", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d66ebf861ff22 R16.6 P2.5 h2.0 or0.9 L4035 1/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.1,0.0] +q | App metadata", :response-chars 2148, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 7, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "dc28e7230da2;3df2de7a83e9", :enrichment-hits 61, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 7939, :pool-head "d0bf345a546d