urces [1].\n- **Altinn Broker client GUI**: Altinn Studio based default GUI for file upload and download, serving as an alternative to custom end-user systems [1].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-broker-08-news-enhancements-en", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 436, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "lookup,simple,list,altinn-broker", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d0fd4df1a9003 R26.2 P3.8 h3.0 or1.3 L2833 1/? ty:content+metadata+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.5,0.2,0.0] | News", :response-chars 498, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "7fcc0669c880", :enrichment-hits 0, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 7718, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "7fcc0669c880", :expected-chunk-ids "7fcc0669c880", :elapsed-ms 286195, :issued-queries "Altinn 3 Broker vs Altinn 2 features | Altinn broker service communication architecture | what is altinn broker new capabilities", :timestamp "2026-06-12T12:33:45.719931Z", :total-tokens 8154, :run-id "31178113-46f6-44bd-aaa4-31d6850328c3", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Based on the provided context, Altinn 3 Broker introduces three specifically highlighted enhancements compared to Altinn 2 [1]:\n\n- **Support for really large files**: Enables support for transfer of files larger than 2 GB, up to 100 GB or more [1].\n- **Altinn Broker configuration GUI**: Provides an Altinn Studio based GUI for configuration of Altinn Broker resources [1].\n- **Altinn Broker client GUI**: Serves as an Altinn Studio based default GUI for file upload and download, acting as an alternative to custom end-user systems [1].\n\nAll three enhancements are scheduled for release in Q4 2025 according to the source material [1]. Source [1] explicitly frames these as the highlighted improvements over Altinn 2. (Note: Source [2] discusses a \"Transition Service\" that bridges communication between existing Altinn 2 and migrated Altinn 3 broker services, but it does not list additional new feature enhancements for Altinn 3 Broker itself.)", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-broker-08-news-enhancements-en", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 437, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed+enrichment", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "lookup,simple,list,altinn-broker", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d0fd4df1a9003 R18.0 P4.6 h4.0 or0.6 L2833 1/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+metadata+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.5,0.1,0.0] +q | News", :response-chars 947, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 15, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "7fcc0669c880;5a6f79fe08ae", :enrichment-hits 29, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 7892, :pool-head "dfc4f74301e59 R19.3 P2.5 h2.0 or1.0 L1902 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Basic concepts ;; d32b33dd7d78f R18.9 P2.5 h2.0 or0.6 L1578 0/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Broker ;; db6c43b81c669 R18.8 P2.5 h2.0 or0.6 L417 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Technical overview ;; db6c43b81c669 R18.7 P3.5 h3.0 or0.5 L385 1/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Technical overview ;; d0fd4df1a9003 R18.6 P2.5 h2.0 or0.4 L579 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | News ;; d4723f71d82f9 R18.6 P2.5 h2.0 or0.8 L1878 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | System interfaces ;; d17d3c3058f6c R18.5 P2.5 h2.0 or0.3 L524 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Service owner ;; de960d2f402e0 R18.5 P3.5 h3.0 or1.2 L807 1/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] +q | Getting started", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "7fcc0669c880;5a6f79fe08ae", :expected-chunk-ids "7fcc0669c880", :elapsed-ms 248130, :issued-queries "altinn broker ny funksjoner i forhold til altinn | broker tjenestekatalog vs brokertjendeste | broker service vs legacy altinn2", :timestamp "2026-06-12T12:34:15.027898Z", :total-tokens 8329, :run-id "463ca6ab-0eb9-4ca1-9fa1-fed75f0d1707", :golden-display-rank 15, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Based on the provided documentation, transferring a file using the Altinn 2 Broker SOAP transition interface consists of three explicit steps:\n\n1. **Step 1: Initiate file transfer**  \n   Send an `InitiateBrokerServiceBasic` request to start the broker service process and obtain a transaction reference that will be used in subsequent calls [3]. This response typically returns a unique identifier (e.g., `<InitiateBrokerServiceBasicResult>...</InitiateBrokerServiceBasicResult>`), which you must pass as your Reference header value for Step 2 [3].\n\n2. **Step 2: Upload File**  \n   Send the actual file data using the `StreamedPayloadBasicBE` operation, including the transaction reference from Step 1 along with sender credentials and metadata in the SOAP header [3]. This call returns an immediate pseudo-receipt containing `<ReceiptId>0</ReceiptId>` ⚠️ **Warning**: Because Altinn 3 handles upload processing asynchronously, this initial receipt status does not necessarily reflect whether the file has finished processing or is ready for download [2].\n\n3. **Step 3: Verify successful processing/retrieval**  \n   Make a `GetAvailableFilesBasic` request on behalf of the sender to check if the uploaded file appears in the recipient's available files list with an `<FileStatus>Uploaded</FileStatus>` (or later `<FileStatus>Downloaded</FileStatus>`) [3]. The documentation notes that Altinn 2 SOAP Broker Service does not natively expose a function for end users to verify final processing completion, so this polling step is recommended as a workaround to ensure the file has been successfully processed and made available before recipients attempt to download it [2], [3].\n\n*Note: All endpoints referenced in these steps route through Altinn 3's transition layer. For most requests on transitioned services, there will be no functional difference compared to legacy Altinn 2 calls [1].*", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-broker-07-soap-transition-steps-en", :empty? false, :llm-calls 7, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 1044, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed+enrichment", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "compound,lookup,list,altinn-broker", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d233774626f6d R21.0 P1.3 h1.0 or0.2 L5930 2/? ty:metadata b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.1,0.2,0.0] | Soap", :response-chars 1889, :source "new", :search-passes 2, :n-retrieved 3, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 2, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "86a2c4a99e3b;c7a8b41099e9;33f477a9ebce", :enrichment-hits 85, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? false, :n-cited 3, :prompt-tokens 34324, :pool-head "d233774626f6d R23.1 P2.6 h2.0 or1.0 L1518 1/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Soap", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "86a2c4a99e3b;c7a8b41099e9;33f477a9ebce", :expected-chunk-ids "33f477a9ebce", :elapsed-ms 594901, :issued-queries "altinn 2 broker soap | overføring av filer via altinn broker overgangsgrensesnitt | broker soapservice motta melding | upload file broker soap sendMelding | send melding motta filer brokertjeneste ws | Altinn 2 formidlingstjenester senderesipient oppdateredokument", :timestamp "2026-06-12T12:35:36.650664Z", :total-tokens 35368, :run-id "a0bd16fc-c352-49ad-80e8-3f2d34d49df8", :golden-display-rank 2, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Basert på konteksten fremheves følgende produktforbedringer for Altinn 3 Formidling sammenliknet med Altinn 2 [1]:\n- Støtte for virkelig store filer [1]\n- GUI for konfigurering [1]\n- Klient-GUI [1]", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-broker-09-news-enhancements-nb", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 415, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed+enrichment", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "lookup,simple,list,altinn-broker", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d2bf0e8df239a R24.2 P4.9 h4.0 or2.2 L2760 1/? ty:content+hypothetical-questions+metadata+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.5,0.2,0.0] +q | News", :response-chars 197, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 1, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "65f294cac473", :enrichment-hits 38, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 1, :prompt-tokens 8206, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "65f294cac473", :expected-chunk-ids "65f294cac473", :elapsed-ms 191302, :issued-queries "altinn 3 formidling produktforbedringer sammenlikning med altinn 2 | altinn formidling altinn", :timestamp "2026-06-12T12:37:26.333499Z", :total-tokens 8621, :run-id "a0c248cf-3b3b-41fc-8247-1d158ba88063", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Basert på dokumentasjonen finner jeg følgende produktforbedringer som fremheves for Altinn 3 Formidling sammenliknet med Altinn 2:\n\n## Produktforbedringer i Altinn 3 Formidling (Q4 2025)\n\nIfølge [Nyheter og videre planer](nb/broker/news/index.md) er det mange produktforbedringer, hvor et utvalg av de viktigste er:\n\n1. **Støtte for virkelig store filer** – Støtte for overføring av filer større enn 2 GB, opp til 100 GB og mer ([GitHub #525](https://github.com/Altinn/altinn-broker/issues/525)).\n\n2. **GUI for konfigurering** – GUI i Altinn Studio for konfiguering av ressurser i Altinn Formidling, som forenkler oppsett sammenliknet med den mer tekniske håndteringen i Altinn 2 ([GitHub #375](https://github.com/Altinn/altinn-broker/issues/375)).\n\n3. **Klient-GUI** – GUI i Altinn Studio for opplasting og nedlasting av filer, som et alternativ til andre sluttbrukersystemer ([GitHub #523](https://github.com/Altinn/altinn-broker/issues/523)).\n\nI tillegg er selve omleggingen fra den eldre plattformen i Altinn 2 over på en ny **skybasert teknologiplattform** (Azure) sentral, med blant annet:\n- Skyhosting og DDOS-beskyttelse\n- Feiltoleranse og robusthet ved levering av svært store filer\n- Skalerbarhet og tilgjengelighet\n- Ende-til-ende synlighet og revisjonsdyktighet (loggføring)\n- Observabilitet med metadata-støtte for analyse av overføringssekvenser\n\nTjenesteeiere har to migreringsmuligheter fra Altinn 2: *hard overgang* eller *myk overgang*, hvor den myke varianten fungerer som en bro mellom løsningene mens brukere og sluttbrukersystemer migrerer på individuell basis.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "stop", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-broker-09-news-enhancements-nb", :empty? false, :llm-calls 6, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 1743, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "lookup,simple,list,altinn-broker", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d2bf0e8df239a R24.0 P3.8 h3.0 or1.7 L2760 1/? ty:content+metadata+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.5,0.2,0.0] | News", :response-chars 1583, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 6, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "65f294cac473;b12d744af484;87b5028fdcae;f2c87d24c5be;9584a6e89afc;71edc1fa4e22", :enrichment-hits 0, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 0, :prompt-tokens 30640, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "", :expected-chunk-ids "65f294cac473", :elapsed-ms 454343, :issued-queries "altinn 3 formidling produktforbedringer sammenlignet med altinn 2 | altinn formidling altinn", :timestamp "2026-06-12T12:41:20.066478Z", :total-tokens 32383, :run-id "af56cb2e-1311-467b-9b8a-5baec2ef4917", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Basert på den medfølgende konteksten finnes det ingen eksplisitt definert eller oppstilt liste som uttrykkelig bærer betegnelsen **«ikkje-funksjonelle krav-kategorier»** for Altinn 3 Formidling [1–10]. Dokumentet beskriver i stedet tilsvarende kvalitetsmål, sikkerhetsaspekter og arkitekturelle forventninger under andre spesifikke labeler/overskrifter. De semantisk nærmeste kategoriene som fremkommer er:\n\n- **Overordnede arkitekturprinsipper** som skal støtte virksomhetsarkitektur, bidra til økt samhandlingsevne på tvers av sektor og sikre etterlevelse av EU-regelverk [1].\n- **Støtte for lokal hosting og datalagring**, som muliggjør at brukere velger egen privat sky eller `on-premise` istedenfor Altinns default-hostingvalg [1], [2].\n- **Framtidssikker arkitektur** med fokus på samsvar, samhandling/gjenbruk i lys av endrende internasjonale forskrifter, standarder og teknologier [1].\n- **«Beskyttelse under overføring»** (filoverføringer krypteres og sendes via TLS/HTTPS) [3].\n- **«Beskyttelse under lagring»** (kryptoografisk sikret fillagring i Azure Blob Storage, metadata-kryptering i PostgreSQL samt sjekksumkontroll for å garantere integritet ved opplasting/nedlasting) [3], [4].\n- **Skalering og operasjonell innsikt**, som håndteres gjennom Azure API Management (APIM) på tvers av delte plattformtjenester [5].\n\nHvis det finnes en spesifikk, offisielt kategorisert matrise eller modell for «ikke-funksjonelle krav» i Altinn 3-dokumentasjonen, er denne ikke dekket av den oppgitte kildeteksten. Jeg har nevnt semantisk nærmeste kvalitets- og sikkerhetskategoriene som fremkommer direkte fra konteksten, og bevart kildefradragets originale formuleringer [1–9].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? false, :question-id "wg-broker-10-capabilities-nfr-categories-nb", :empty? false, :llm-calls 6, :citation-recall 0.0, :completion-tokens 1234, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 0.0, :config-id "deployed", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "compound,lookup,list,altinn-broker", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features nil, :response-chars 1677, :source "new", :search-passes 2, :n-retrieved 13, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? false, :golden-pool-rank nil, :golden-read? false, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "4b02864dfddd;3b77f705718d;0163c135d55c;b12d744af484;58a7b8ea31c4;3e338f2417fa;355f4b3ff745;acf63eccce51;3a6db3bb34a8;baa5a2c83539;95951c3a71d1;070ca8e5436f;fc5d498edb61", :enrichment-hits 0, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 0.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? false, :n-cited 5, :prompt-tokens 50086, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "4b02864dfddd;3b77f705718d;3e338f2417fa;355f4b3ff745;