[1]. Required configurations include top level configurations and Maskinporten settings[2]. It provides functionality for retrieving application/instance information, including:\n  * `GetData`: Fetches data elements from Storage. Data can be fetched for an application using different filter criteria or directly for a specific owner and instance[2].\n  * `GetInstance`: Fetches the metadata of an instance from Platform Storage[1]. It includes an option called `savetofile` to store the instance object as a JSON file in the configured `StorageOutputFolder`, rather than writing it directly to the console[2].", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-tech-04-cli-commands", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 342, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed+enrichment", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "compound,lookup,altinn-3-general,list", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d79c43d59e568 R20.4 P2.6 h2.0 or1.2 L3353 0/? ty:content+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.4,0.0,0.0] | Commands", :response-chars 1477, :source "new", :search-passes 1, :n-retrieved 2, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "75f60f7d94c2;8ba819792e78", :enrichment-hits 34, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? nil, :n-cited 2, :prompt-tokens 7723, :pool-head "", :repeat 0, :error nil, :cited-chunk-ids "75f60f7d94c2;8ba819792e78", :expected-chunk-ids "75f60f7d94c2", :elapsed-ms 251403, :issued-queries "altinn cli kommandoer default commands usage | altinn cli", :timestamp "2026-06-12T14:01:38.055886Z", :total-tokens 8065, :run-id "a0398efa-c69f-4db9-b41b-6b733a69570c", :golden-display-rank 1, :steps-executed 3, :dataset "public-docs", :length-finish? false, :recall-at-5 1.0} {:response "Based on the provided context, the `IOption` interface defines the following properties and one method `[1]`:\n\n* **Name** (`string`): The name of the option that must match the corresponding entry in the CommandDefinition file ``[1]``\n* **ApiName** (`string`): The name of the option as it appears in the API being accessed ``[1]``\n* **Value** (`string`): Stores the raw value of the option as a string ``[1]``\n* **IsAssigned** (`bool`): Indicates whether the option was explicitly provided with a value on the command line ``[1]``\n* **Description** (`string`): A human-readable description used by the help command ``[1]``\n* **Range** (`string`): Specifies valid constraints or ranges for the parameter ``[1]``\n* **GetValue()**: While technically a method, it is defined within this interface and returns an `object` containing the typed value of the option based on its definition in the configuration file ``[1]``\n\nAll members are declared exactly as shown in the source code snippet provided in reference `[1]`.", :terminal-clarification? false, :finish-reason "tool_calls", :golden-in-display? true, :question-id "wg-tech-03-ioption-properties", :empty? false, :llm-calls 3, :citation-recall 1.0, :completion-tokens 547, :insufficiency-fired? false, :recall-at-10 1.0, :config-id "deployed+enrichment", :clarification-rounds 0, :question-tags "compound,lookup,altinn-3-general,list", :cached-tokens 0, :golden-features "d46869a1c1189 R— P3.7 h3.0 or1.5 L3498 5/? ty:content+metadata+phrase b[0.0,0.0,0.0,0.5,0.1,0.0] | Software implementation", :response-chars 1015, :source "new", :search-passes 2, :n-retrieved 8, :reasoning-tokens 0, :golden-in-search-pool? true, :golden-pool-rank 1, :golden-read? true, :grounding-mode :chunks+answer, :answer-substring-hit? true, :retrieved-chunk-ids "12c9fc2ec225;9d80c0e82e0d;adfaca6c321b;5e582415014c;03f8aa749887;779eabdbb999;e97d8370409f;2aefffe06960", :enrichment-hits 114, :n-expected 1, :status "complete", :recall-at-20 1.0, :refinement-corpus-grounded? fa